 from this effect their body will explode in a radius %d shower of bone and gore, inflicting physical damage equal to the current tick to all enemies and granting you 4 combo points.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使用你深刻的解剖学知识，击中敌人的穴道造成 %d%% 武器伤害，无视闪避和躲闪效果。\n\t\t这次攻击在敌人身上造成可怕的内伤，在四回合内造成相当于攻击伤害的 100%% 的物理伤害，每回合增加 %d%% (4 回合后，总共造成 %d%% 伤害)。\n\t\t如果目标死在该效果下，他们身体会爆炸，并让半径 %d 内的敌人受到等于他们当前回合的点穴伤害的物理伤害，并给你 4 点连击点。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec360552153a5058ff9e1dc9de9910cca7259070c92b21d8afdb20014c8deb61","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6ac2d13a2d6a01948fe15d23c1ed258b9589ce656d4c50ae316913d5c75c072d","logical_entry_identity":"654e472bc5af94883bb1269d165968b5d8ca567f2ca41b4758471e94bce96a69","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# has survived the void madness.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#从虚空的疯狂中幸存了下来。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7ea05ace1aabb12d1e12b3470464d494a050e78602696145da537db0a4cf16b9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6ac576b81d1b1c8fec5eb3f6299d3d093c595c23c884ddbd2bfde0b892e2553c","logical_entry_identity":"b71b1d8a4c8672bd117929fe3858bea09ca2717df5ceef5946a53b187b0c20a4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The siege arrow creates a shockwave!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"攻城矢引发了冲击波！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6951dace684271d9a4c793b61e96d6dc2aa4789f2a2274aae93f54bf18f3b06a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6ac964a809e47c563cfe410d164eba322d0f6ccbf4bea881ad2d0e458e1135ad","logical_entry_identity":"7fa48fdf9509787bb4c610bc0d806a37f0f32022a5126a89c65751e43a230c1c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"phys crit magnitude","source_tag":"entity name","target":"物理暴击伤害"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3f5c1ffba69345dcb23bf00b4e0b3d08d00fbf9e351072c5f685ca2a5a07efb4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6acb5e7664d60c0378497b784a9fe77ed5673c6eeab86bce4ad0502dd1ae6672","logical_entry_identity":"c52a066208522bc04210aeec7f86daaf851178fe4593e2163884c28c837