害（最高 %d 点），波及你周围半径 %d 内的所有生物。\n\t\t此外，休息时你每回合被动回复 %0.2f 点法力。\n\t\t护盾强度受意志加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2810903ddf2aeab063ab0e61483492d8f45895cb0bee5a6f4efc3d16b3774409","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6b574bbda5d5c277d86f8d440871a37fccf62a8a15cd29a71a00ace135c41452","logical_entry_identity":"3663d3ef9caf949a4406f60770bef3764e501072c159be6156f3bf23347871c0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thank you, Elisa!","source_tag":"_t","target":"谢谢你，埃莉萨！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ca08d6629f2b53e33bfaa7c90cad9ba73d0bfcf4c3cad21b10ae541e3daea2b3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6b5fbcb6e64e55059a96f2323b85bb983fe14cc9c89d8e52ae4981a0b96f5186","logical_entry_identity":"985eb032a2c6e3c1405e3cd106c53b1ed5ee65d89fbcb9fc1f5a79346bd5d938","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Physical power reduced by %d","source_tag":"tformat","target":"物理强度降低 %d"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2f0cd922ae9165cd592750e3252401670baa673230a1afb1caaa5fed9ac58ec1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6b69ead8ee79417f413e1d800f036e854011c2a8e660c90f47b05f291d0e7368","logical_entry_identity":"126a95997a3df2d9bfeab84340145e299fee675fadb47617e0d88d4cb3d64ccc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Elemental Split","source_tag":"talent name","target":"元素分裂"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d6714c737b54e049e4631886a7c6db0fcbfafaab3d4f276ffa863dfab2781ab7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6b78f233fdd073ae891f75d9c1e4db106298a07714d5388e1057b8339dd8a3bb","logical_entry_identity":"623d4d5b4cf55276ec5ae9d84d87bc9ea7d60765dc563deadd85f9a9b25e2bc9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Enhances your Deadly Poison with a leeching agent, causing it to heal you for %d%% of the damage it does to its target.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"在你的武器上涂上吸血毒素，你受到中毒伤害 %d%% 的治疗。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c53f978359bf7e5e208527150a0b29afbe3ffa686e23ffabc09efdc35b02c04a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6